WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.382 --> 00:00:04.118
CARAVAN.

00:00:01.782 --> 00:00:05.019
THAT'S THE FOCUS OF TONIGHT'S

00:00:04.252 --> 00:00:05.019
ANGLE.

00:00:07.622 --> 00:00:11.259
YOU HAVE SEEN THESE PHOTOS.

00:00:09.223 --> 00:00:13.561
WELL, THE CURRENT SITUATION AT

00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:15.596
OUR SOUTHERN BORDER, IS

00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:17.164
COMPLETELY OUT OF HAND.

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:18.866
THAT CARAVAN OF CENTRAL

00:00:17.298 --> 00:00:20.801
AMERICAN MIGRANTS THAT STARTED

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:24.939
DOWN TO ABOUT 200 PEOPLE OR SO,

00:00:23.337 --> 00:00:26.374
AND MANY OF THEM ARE CAMPED

00:00:25.072 --> 00:00:29.143
OUT AT JUST A STONE'S THROW

00:00:26.507 --> 00:00:29.510
FROM THE U.S. CUSTOMS CHECK

00:00:29.277 --> 00:00:31.145
POINT.

00:00:29.644 --> 00:00:33.548
NOW, AS WE HAVE BEEN REPORTING,

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:35.750
THE ALIENS ARE BEING COACHED

00:00:33.681 --> 00:00:37.618
IN SOME CASES, BY AMERICAN

00:00:35.883 --> 00:00:38.953
LAWYERS, TRAVELING TO THE

00:00:37.752 --> 00:00:41.689
CARAVAN, AND TELLING THEM HOW

00:00:39.086 --> 00:00:43.724
TO QUALIFY FOR ASYLUM.

00:00:41.822 --> 00:00:45.726
THIS UNDOUBTEDLY INFURIATES

00:00:43.858 --> 00:00:47.295
MANY OF YOU, WHO WOULD ALSO

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.563
LOVE FREE LEGAL ADVICE.

00:00:47.428 --> 00:00:49.830
WOULDN'T THAT BE NICE?

00:00:48.696 --> 00:00:50.565
THE PRESIDENT AS WELL IS

00:00:49.964 --> 00:00:51.799
TOTALLY FED UP.

00:00:50.698 --> 00:00:54.368
HE TWEETED THIS WEEK THE

00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:55.703
MIGRANT CARAVAN THAT IS OPENLY

00:00:54.502 --> 00:00:57.572
DEFYING OUR BORDER SHOWS HOW

00:00:55.836 --> 00:00:58.706
WEAK AND INEFFECTIVE U.S.

00:00:57.705 --> 00:00:59.473
IMMIGRATION LAWS ARE.

